  "releaseNotes": "v1.5.3 - Fixes\nResolved netstandard2.0 build failure by replacing usage of HashCode.Combine in OHLCVItem.GetHashCode() with a framework-agnostic implementation.\nNo public API changes. Verified builds across all target frameworks (netstandard2.0, netstandard2.1, net8.0, net9.0).\nHousekeeping\nUpdated package release notes to reflect the fix.\nOptional (single-line for NuGet PackageReleaseNotes):\n\nFix: netstandard2.0 build failure resolved by replacing HashCode.Combine with framework-agnostic hash in OHLCVItem.GetHashCode(). No API changes.",
